        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-03T23:10:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should also be setting the Rp before the power supply is sourcing SafeV5\n\n\"The new Source asserts Rp, then sets its power output to vSafe5V and sends a PS_RDY Message when it is ready to supply power.\" from 8.3.2.6.2 Sink Initiated Power Role Swap without subsequent Power Negotiation",
